WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex

00:00:03.571 --> 00:00:07.371
Terry sent me an invitation!

00:00:08.409 --> 00:00:14.814
Candy's heart is filled with happiness
as she is holding Terry's invitation.

00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:18.378
In the meantime,

00:00:18.528 --> 00:00:22.014
Terry is devastated by what
happened to Susanna.

00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:25.248
Candy, unaware of the accident,

00:00:25.468 --> 00:00:28.354
is departing tomorrow.

00:00:31.165 --> 00:00:37.536
The long awaited reunion

00:00:49.217 --> 00:00:51.611
So, are you ready for tomorrow?

00:00:51.761 --> 00:00:53.881
Almost.

00:00:54.122 --> 00:00:55.381
I will see Terry tomorrow.

00:00:55.531 --> 00:00:56.649
Candy?

00:00:56.799 --> 00:00:58.084
What is it, Mr. Albert?

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:00.286
You are thinking about Terry.

00:01:00.436 --> 00:01:01.953
Not true!

00:01:02.363 --> 00:01:06.629
When I was working at the London Zoo,
although I don't remember it clearly,

00:01:07.068 --> 00:01:08.501
did I see Terry very often?

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:12.863
You were like brothers back then.

00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:15.668
I would really like to see him again.

00:01:15.818 --> 00:01:18.237
Yes. And I am sure it's the same for him.

00:01:18.387 --> 00:01:19.639
Say hi to Terry for me.

00:01:19.789 --> 00:01:20.976
OK.

00:01:21.315 --> 00:01:24.924
It's getting colder.
It might snow tomorrow.

00:01:25.194 --> 00:01:27.246
- Mr. Albert?
- Yes?

00:01:27.396 --> 00:01:30.483
While I am away,
if your memory comes back,

00:01:30.633 --> 00:01:32.318
promise me to wait until I get back.

00:01:32.468 --> 00:01:33.986
I will, Candy.

00:01:34.136 --> 00:01:37.623
Don't worry about me,
and enjoy your trip.

00:01:37.773 --> 00:01:39.757
Thank you, Mr. Albert.

00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:41.394
You need to get up early tomorrow.

00:01:41.544 --> 00:01:43.596
I'll take care of this,
so you can go to bed early.

00:01:43.746 --> 00:01:45.070
OK.

00:02:12.733 --> 00:02:14.633
You're still awake, Brother?

00:02:15.536 --> 00:02:16.996
I gotta finish this new project.

00:02:17.146 --> 00:02:20.507
I'm wondering what is keeping you so busy.
Don't stay up to late.

00:02:23.978 --> 00:02:27.840
Brother, do you think Candy will
come back after her stay with Terry?

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.442
Of course.

00:02:29.592 --> 00:02:32.726
What if Terry
persuades her to stay with him?

00:02:32.876 --> 00:02:34.781
Mr. Albert is still not
remembering anything.

00:02:34.931 --> 00:02:36.883
Candy is a very responsible person.

00:02:37.033 --> 00:02:38.284
She will be back.

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:41.120
I'm sure you are right. Good night.

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:42.753
Good night.

00:03:09.857 --> 00:03:12.451
Where did I put Terry's invitation?

00:03:13.994 --> 00:03:15.488
Not here...

00:03:15.638 --> 00:03:17.724
Found it!

00:03:19.633 --> 00:03:20.930
Good morning, Candy.

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:23.028
You don't have to come
with me at the station.

00:03:23.178 --> 00:03:24.797
Your hat is not right.

00:03:24.947 --> 00:03:28.530
Ok, go back to sleep,
I don't want you to catch a cold.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.870
I guess it's not easy for you
to get up so early to take the train,

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.503
it must be tiring.

00:03:36.517 --> 00:03:37.841
Good morning, Poope.

00:03:43.257 --> 00:03:45.284
It's freezing outside, isn't it?

00:03:45.434 --> 00:03:48.692
I have to leave right away,
I'm going to be late.

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:50.889
Candy, let me accompany you.

00:03:51.039 --> 00:03:53.292
No, I don't want you to catch a cold.

00:03:53.442 --> 00:03:56.295
I'll bring you a gift, Poope. Bye!

00:03:56.445 --> 00:03:57.847
Candy!

00:03:59.373 --> 00:04:01.307
She is so independent.

00:04:04.878 --> 00:04:07.506
Candy, come back soon.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:14.596
As long as I have you beside me,
I don't mind having lost my memory.

00:04:14.746 --> 00:04:18.607
I will be satisfied
just to live in peace every day.

00:04:54.611 --> 00:04:57.505
There is barely anyone
taking the first train.

00:04:57.655 --> 00:04:59.104
Candy!

00:04:59.649 --> 00:05:01.549
- Candy!
- Stear!

00:05:03.253 --> 00:05:05.613
I'm not too late!
I thought I wouldn't be able to make it.

00:05:05.763 --> 00:05:07.588
Stear,
did you come here just to say good-bye?

00:05:08.725 --> 00:05:11.626
You didn't have to, it's so early.

00:05:12.762 --> 00:05:15.156
You are travelling far away
all by yourself. Poor girl.

00:05:15.306 --> 00:05:17.727
Nonsense! I'll be back soon.

00:05:21.871 --> 00:05:24.866
Stear,
Why are you acting so different today?

00:05:25.016 --> 00:05:26.738
I'm not...

00:05:26.943 --> 00:05:28.336
Say ''hi'' to Terry for me.

00:05:28.486 --> 00:05:32.580
Okay.
I'll bring back some gifts.

00:05:38.354 --> 00:05:41.114
Aren't you cold?
You should board the train, Candy.

00:05:42.358 --> 00:05:44.993
It'll be fine, I'll be leaving soon.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:51.893
- Candy...
- Stear...

00:05:52.043 --> 00:05:52.992
What is it, Candy?

00:05:54.203 --> 00:05:58.232
We never had the chance
to talk alone like this.

00:05:58.382 --> 00:05:59.534
That's right.

00:05:59.684 --> 00:06:01.270
Stear, I...

00:06:07.149 --> 00:06:08.452
The train is leaving.

00:06:11.587 --> 00:06:13.347
I am on my way.

00:06:13.497 --> 00:06:15.151
- Candy...
- What?

00:06:15.591 --> 00:06:18.526
A present for you... My new invention.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.156
What is this?

00:06:22.306 --> 00:06:24.859
I called it ''the Candy happy box''.

00:06:25.067 --> 00:06:27.001
What a great name!

00:06:29.472 --> 00:06:32.403
It's so pretty.
Thank you, Stear.

00:06:35.978 --> 00:06:40.275
Candy, this melody
will bring you happiness.

00:06:40.425 --> 00:06:42.110
Thank you, Stear.

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:44.653
I really want you to be happy, Candy!

00:06:44.821 --> 00:06:48.454
You are acting so strange, Stear.
We are not saying good-bye forever.

00:06:53.462 --> 00:06:54.827
Good-bye, Stear!

00:06:59.335 --> 00:07:00.768
Candy...

00:07:01.737 --> 00:07:03.130
What is it, Stear?

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:04.670
Candy...

00:07:06.742 --> 00:07:08.102
Good bye!

00:07:08.252 --> 00:07:09.403
Candy...

00:07:09.653 --> 00:07:11.369
What is it, Stear?

00:07:11.619 --> 00:07:14.807
Good-bye, Candy, be careful!

00:07:19.788 --> 00:07:21.751
Good-bye, Candy...

00:07:51.086 --> 00:07:54.283
I am going to meet Terry again.

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:06.565
Terry!

00:08:07.102 --> 00:08:08.262
Candy!

00:08:09.204 --> 00:08:10.330
Terry!

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:11.667
Candy!

00:08:12.541 --> 00:08:13.701
Terry!

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:20.507
You are finally here, Candy!

00:08:20.657 --> 00:08:22.777
It's been so long since we met, Terry!

00:08:24.052 --> 00:08:26.577
Wait for me, Terry. I am coming!

00:08:27.589 --> 00:08:29.880
This is a beautiful melody, miss.

00:08:30.892 --> 00:08:34.658
It brings back many beautiful memories.

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:37.237
Are you going to see a good friend?

00:08:37.407 --> 00:08:39.559
Yes, in New York.

00:08:39.709 --> 00:08:43.524
It's good to be young.
I don't have any friends.

00:08:43.714 --> 00:08:45.932
Grandpa, where are you going?

00:08:46.082 --> 00:08:50.068
To visit my wife's grave.

00:10:16.664 --> 00:10:17.995
It is so bright!

00:10:20.568 --> 00:10:24.129
It's so beautiful,
It's like if it was wishing me good luck.

00:10:25.273 --> 00:10:27.767
New York is getting closer, Terry!

00:10:27.917 --> 00:10:29.867
Just wait for a little while, Terry,
I am almost there!

00:11:17.858 --> 00:11:20.252
New York! I am finally here!

00:11:20.402 --> 00:11:22.621
There are so many people
in the station!

00:11:22.771 --> 00:11:24.323
But where is Terry?

00:11:24.473 --> 00:11:28.561
There are so many people,
will he come to pick me up?

00:11:28.711 --> 00:11:31.366
How should I greet Terry?

00:11:33.574 --> 00:11:36.338
Terry... Finally, I'm seeing you.

00:11:39.046 --> 00:11:41.178
It's boring.

00:11:46.787 --> 00:11:49.081
Why is Terry late?

00:11:49.231 --> 00:11:51.647
Letting a lady wait for so long.

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.758
Terry!
I recognize him from behind.

00:11:56.397 --> 00:11:57.737
He didn't change at all.

00:11:57.987 --> 00:12:00.861
Terry, here I am!

00:12:02.403 --> 00:12:06.170
When he turns around,
what will be his reaction?

00:12:06.306 --> 00:12:09.507
Gently smiling, and then...

00:12:12.246 --> 00:12:14.646
Terry... Terry!

00:12:15.983 --> 00:12:17.310
You don't look like...

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:19.178
Look like what?

00:12:19.328 --> 00:12:22.245
Nothing,
I thought you were someone else.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.821
Why are you pulling me?

00:12:28.971 --> 00:12:31.057
You can't fool me so easily!

00:12:32.232 --> 00:12:34.426
Let me go or I'll bite you!

00:12:35.903 --> 00:12:37.894
You are still so rough!

00:12:39.373 --> 00:12:40.465
Terry!

00:12:40.841 --> 00:12:41.967
Candy...

00:12:42.117 --> 00:12:43.335
Terry...

00:12:43.485 --> 00:12:46.868
Terry is in front of me.

00:12:48.215 --> 00:12:50.383
You didn't change a bit.

00:12:51.785 --> 00:12:53.912
Candy,
I want to hold you so much.

00:12:54.062 --> 00:12:59.254
But, I can't say that out.

00:13:41.868 --> 00:13:46.237
You matured a lot,
and grew up a lot.

00:13:47.207 --> 00:13:49.107
- You...
- ...did not change.

00:13:52.679 --> 00:13:54.473
You are so mean, Candy!

00:13:54.623 --> 00:13:57.073
Sorry, I didn't mean it.

00:13:57.817 --> 00:13:59.626
You are really the same.

00:13:59.776 --> 00:14:02.381
I can't believe
they let you in the nursing school.

00:14:02.822 --> 00:14:04.722
You are rude. I AM a nurse!

00:14:04.958 --> 00:14:07.419
That's right!
You are a real nurse now.

00:14:07.569 --> 00:14:09.336
Congratulations, Miss Freckles.

00:14:09.486 --> 00:14:11.323
You are so mean, Terry.

00:14:11.473 --> 00:14:15.727
Terry,
congratulations on your Romeo role.

00:14:15.997 --> 00:14:17.633
Thanks, Candy.

00:14:25.612 --> 00:14:27.807
I missed you so much, Terry.

00:14:28.281 --> 00:14:32.944
Me, too.
I even dreamed about you.

00:14:33.194 --> 00:14:35.781
I would like to take this chance...

00:14:36.189 --> 00:14:38.981
Terry,
why didn't you show up earlier?

00:14:39.131 --> 00:14:42.094
I thought that person was you.

00:14:42.395 --> 00:14:44.589
I saw that. It scared you.

00:14:44.739 --> 00:14:47.064
I thought you had
some problem with your eyes.

00:14:48.034 --> 00:14:52.730
He looked like you from behind.
Didn't expect you would disguise yourself.

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.397
Of course I have to stay incognito.

00:14:54.908 --> 00:14:57.168
I make a living out of my face.

00:14:57.318 --> 00:15:00.178
It's nice, but...

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:02.472
What's wrong?

00:15:02.682 --> 00:15:06.377
Nothing.
This place is not romantic at all.

00:15:06.527 --> 00:15:10.047
We have been looking forward
to this reunion for a long time.

00:15:12.658 --> 00:15:14.781
This is really not a good place.

00:15:14.931 --> 00:15:16.501
Let me take you to the hotel first.

00:15:16.671 --> 00:15:19.157
I want to see where you live first.

00:15:19.307 --> 00:15:20.792
The place I live?

00:15:20.942 --> 00:15:23.094
I want to see how it looks like.

00:15:23.244 --> 00:15:24.727
OK, I'll take you there.

00:15:25.137 --> 00:15:26.331
Is this all your luggage?

00:15:26.505 --> 00:15:28.232
You are carrying the luggage for me?

00:15:28.482 --> 00:15:31.300
It's rude to let a lady
carry the luggage.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:35.312
Good!
You finally think I am a lady.

00:15:36.482 --> 00:15:38.509
Of course, Lady Freckles.

00:15:38.659 --> 00:15:39.944
You are so mean.

00:15:40.094 --> 00:15:41.743
You too.

00:15:41.888 --> 00:15:45.153
Candy, I have always wanted
to take a walk with you.

00:15:49.662 --> 00:15:51.254
Candy, get in.

00:15:52.364 --> 00:15:54.457
This is your car? Is it working?

00:15:54.833 --> 00:15:58.329
Of course! It is better than your
friend's, the inventor!

00:15:58.479 --> 00:16:01.703
Stear says ''hi'' to you.

00:16:03.008 --> 00:16:04.235
That's right. Stear!

00:16:04.385 --> 00:16:09.240
How are they all? The dressy one,
the reserved one and the fat one?

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:12.876
Archie, Annie, Patty.
Say their names properly!

00:16:13.352 --> 00:16:15.679
Yes, Teacher Freckles!

00:16:15.829 --> 00:16:17.153
Terry, you!

00:16:23.696 --> 00:16:27.530
Candy, I feel so happy with you.

00:16:36.175 --> 00:16:39.042
Does this city never rest?

00:16:39.511 --> 00:16:40.860
Right.

00:16:43.349 --> 00:16:46.644
So pretty... I can see their breasts!

00:16:46.794 --> 00:16:48.710
Terry, that one, too!

00:16:51.323 --> 00:16:52.750
You didn't change at all.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:55.219
I didn't expect
you would become a nurse one day.

00:16:55.369 --> 00:16:57.888
It's a miracle.

00:16:58.338 --> 00:17:00.823
Yes, only if there is a miracle...

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.494
Only if there is a miracle,

00:17:03.644 --> 00:17:06.629
otherwise, Susanna will be sitting
in a wheelchair for the rest of her life.

00:17:09.208 --> 00:17:11.168
Susanna loves you.

00:17:11.318 --> 00:17:15.907
She sees you as the person
who she can depend on forever.

00:17:16.081 --> 00:17:19.676
Terrius, don't abandon her.

00:17:38.804 --> 00:17:41.796
Terry, watch out!

00:17:47.813 --> 00:17:51.575
Terrius,
please stay beside her forever.

00:17:51.725 --> 00:17:55.513
Take care of her all your life.

00:17:57.789 --> 00:18:02.988
I am already seeing someone.
Why couldn't I say it to Mrs Marlowe?

00:18:03.862 --> 00:18:06.888
Susanna, are you alright?

00:18:11.002 --> 00:18:13.396
Susanna!

00:18:19.411 --> 00:18:22.472
It's not your fault.

00:18:22.622 --> 00:18:24.400
I can't lie to Mother.

00:18:26.184 --> 00:18:28.744
Don't worry about it.
Focus on your show.

00:18:29.755 --> 00:18:33.383
You are with her, right?

00:18:33.533 --> 00:18:35.485
You ruined my daughter's life.

00:18:35.635 --> 00:18:38.388
You have to stay with her
all your life.

00:18:38.538 --> 00:18:42.297
Stay with her forever...

00:18:45.136 --> 00:18:47.259
Terry!

00:18:47.409 --> 00:18:49.733
Terry, what's wrong?

00:18:49.883 --> 00:18:52.436
Nothing.
We are getting close to my house.

00:19:05.223 --> 00:19:06.622
Come in, please.

00:19:07.992 --> 00:19:09.719
Why are you standing there?

00:19:09.869 --> 00:19:12.854
It's so surprising!
I thought it would be messy.

00:19:13.531 --> 00:19:16.466
The cleaning woman
cleans it every three days.

00:19:16.734 --> 00:19:19.162
Mr. Albert helps me clean the house.

00:19:19.312 --> 00:19:21.731
Candy,
you let Mr. Albert do the cleaning?

00:19:21.881 --> 00:19:23.166
Oh no!

00:19:23.316 --> 00:19:24.716
That is too much.

00:19:25.577 --> 00:19:30.173
Mr. Albert insists
I stay away from the cleaning job.

00:19:30.915 --> 00:19:33.349
You always find an excuse.

00:19:34.019 --> 00:19:37.147
This photo doesn't look
like you at all.

00:19:37.722 --> 00:19:39.690
It's not a photo, it's a painting.

00:19:40.625 --> 00:19:44.220
What a nice job!
I thought it was a photo. But...

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:45.621
But what?

00:19:45.771 --> 00:19:48.958
I thought Susanna Marlowe
would play Juliet.

00:19:49.108 --> 00:19:50.933
I didn't expect it to be Karen Kreis.

00:19:51.235 --> 00:19:55.732
Karen must be happy. That's great!

00:19:55.882 --> 00:19:58.799
Susanna must be disappointed.

00:19:59.977 --> 00:20:02.946
No.
I can't tell her about Susanna.

00:20:05.316 --> 00:20:06.908
Candy, the tea is ready.

00:20:07.285 --> 00:20:11.454
What would it be like if I changed
her name to Candice White?

00:20:13.324 --> 00:20:16.418
If it's just in the poster,
I can play Juliet, too.

00:20:17.628 --> 00:20:20.438
You are such a blowhard!

00:20:20.588 --> 00:20:22.590
Terry, do not tease me.

00:20:23.334 --> 00:20:24.426
Candy!

00:20:50.461 --> 00:20:53.692
I don't want Candy to leave me.

00:20:54.632 --> 00:20:57.226
But...

00:20:57.902 --> 00:21:01.599
Terry,
why do you look so serious?

00:21:03.641 --> 00:21:06.735
The tea spilt,
let me make you another one.

00:21:08.579 --> 00:21:11.047
No, let me do it, you are my guest.

00:21:12.717 --> 00:21:17.120
Candy can sense that there
is something wrong with Terry.

00:21:17.455 --> 00:21:20.082
However, in spite of this unease...

00:21:20.232 --> 00:21:23.058
the feeling of happiness
that Terry is bringing her

00:21:23.394 --> 00:21:27.455
has already spread out
in Candy's heart.
